    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. Looking closer at River Point specifically, why would that area be a higher risk compared to the Downtown Core, even though both have high transit use and density? Is it just the living arrangements, or are there other lifestyle or cultural factors in those specific communities that might influence the spread more than others?",
