      "content": "Gotcha, so it's more about the sustained contact. I'm also looking at the social/behavioral side for my report. Some of my colleagues are suggesting that the cultural habits of the immigrant populations in River Point—like certain ways of gathering or even general hygiene practices in high-density housing—might be playing a bigger role in the transmission than just the physical space. How much weight should we give to those kinds of cultural or behavioral differences when assessing the risk in that district?",
